  <section class="about-copy">
    <p>I’m an independent designer and maker based in Paris. I work across identity, editorial design, packaging and digital experiences, always looking for the warm, human idea at the centre of a project.</p>
    <p>My practice is shaped by close observation: handwritten signs, beautifully repaired objects, conversations overheard at the market and the particular colour of the sky just before dinner. I like work that feels clear without feeling cold.</p>
    <h2>How I work</h2>
    <p>I collaborate with thoughtful people and small organisations from the first sketch through to the finished thing. The process is open, practical and curious, with plenty of room for unexpected discoveries.</p>
